{"title":"2009 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2009 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Emily sets up a lemonade stand. She has set-up costs of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/3/59309bdf3e8c0ecbdbe60888412cbbf38bd3e6b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$12.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"52\" height=\"16\" /> and each cup of lemonade costs her <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/d/90dfbdbe7579b90dd9628d52d693f145426a423e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$0.15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> to make. She sells each cup of lemonade for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/5/1a52990ff1664f1102b7b1fac4e7b2106f5e0728.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$0.75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is her profit (money earned minus total cost) if she sells <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> cups of lemonade?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a\" title=\"2009 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1a\">part a</a>, the total cost is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/3/5a3d3afce9890fe5f4803133d82518315b4f2a35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$27.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"52\" height=\"16\" />. Since Emily sells each cup of lemonade for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/5/1a52990ff1664f1102b7b1fac4e7b2106f5e0728.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$0.75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> and she sells <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> cups of lemonade, the money earned is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/0/2700113e3c1ca0e2c5cb2dfab3df32c92ee5c80a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$0.75 \\times 100 = \\$75.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"167\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, her profit is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/5/815a934246c7ca46eb3a093918176db4b9b35b9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75.00 - 27.00 = \\boxed{\\$48.00}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"193\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017221552\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.016 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 39/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 315/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1628/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.616      1 2009_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    6.616      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36998:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017221552 and revision id 285932. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}